                                "example_id": "24c72771-c48f-42b9-b7d6-1930a4bee7a8",
                                "sense_id": "9d9b411d-634e-3abe-8669-3161b7793394",
                                "text": "The constitution adopted at Oakmulgee provides for […] the machinery of government in which the governor and legislature are elective by the people. The judges are appointive by the governor […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38abd956-51ec-4066-b412-f04ef0b940c3",
                                "sense_id": "9d9b411d-634e-3abe-8669-3161b7793394",
                                "text": "It will be kind of nice, a year before your time, to be standing in the way of any appointive plums that may happen to fall; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "415d5935-9450-4f0e-889c-0e9324b211ec",
                                "sense_id": "9d9b411d-634e-3abe-8669-3161b7793394",
                                "text": "‘It was an appointive job at one time but may not be now. […] Well, whatever the method is, appointive or elective, I have my dough on Gerald. He’s the logical choice.’"
                            }
                        ]
